    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期加更的粤语节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>小迈一步主播Melody串台「月经（粤语播客）」</span></p><span></span><p><span>与两位主播：小镜子大世界＋过期罐头Eva</span></p><span></span><p><span>笑谈MBTI带给我们的小感悟！</span></p><span></span><p><span>内含MBTI情境大拷问</span></p><span></span><p><span>和我们一起脑洞大开吧！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Melody：ENFJ 主人公</span></p><span></span><p><span>过期罐头EVA：INTJ 建筑师</span></p><span></span><p><span>小镜子大世界：ESFP 表演者</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>你将听到：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">01:33</a> MBTI的诞生时刻和时代背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 一题判断你的MBTI（一起来玩）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1694">28:14</a> 最满意自己的性格特征是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1779">29:39</a> 相反的性格，是难以配合理解的存在，还是互补平衡的完美伙伴？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2333">38:53</a> MBTI里的“高光时刻”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 情境题1：选择和哪个MBTI做旅游搭子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2860">47:40</a> 情景题2：选择谁来救场，打破尴尬场面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2899">48:19</a> 情境题3：我理想中的人生教练是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2976">49:36</a> 情景题4：被判入狱！（bushi）我的狱友将会是...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3279">54:39</a> 扒开MBTI的外衣，它的内核究竟是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>非常感谢月经（粤语播客）的邀请！祝马年订阅量播放量完播率蹭蹭蹭往上涨！</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家马年红红火火，快乐加“马”！</span></p>]]></description>
