    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>宝宝老师们展信佳！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一期长达1小时20分的博主分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>凝结了主播们10年互联网冲浪心得（bushi）</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>震！撼！发！布！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>这次掏空家底，费尽心机</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>绝对不是蹭大博主们流量</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>而是想在岁末年初和大家互相安利</span></p><span></span><p><span>打破信息差、对抗大数据壁垒😊</span></p><span></span><h2><span>本节目提及博主：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>陈土豆、方头明、阿喵、蟑飞、圆香芹本芹（妻主）、小八王悦伊、碳酸饮料拜拜、十元诗苑、发胖魔灵、云吃吃、4566、喵哒、妮可蹦蹦、野授仙贝、穗穗卷卷、aeec、亚克力枪枪、尤那沙</span></p><span></span><h2><span>你将听到：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="52">00:52</a> 陈土豆：救命🆘她真的好女！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> “自然女”是什么新概念？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1047">17:27</a> 阿喵&amp;蟑飞：性转小视频看起来咋那么爽！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1105">18:25</a> 圆香芹本芹（妻主）：《恭喜发财（女宝版）》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> “云吃吃”缔造的开年神贴，给我们带来什么启发</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo0ZD8cn257KDg6V4sijPXeKrfUG.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（⬆️由🍠博主9415204308整理发布的云吃吃原帖🔗）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a> 小八王悦伊：靠颜值和审美吃饭的博主选择表达</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2628">43:48</a> 发胖魔灵：一款演技很好的互联网妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2913">48:33</a> 4566：互联网心理医生，心灵马杀鸡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3410">56:50</a> 美妆博主推荐：喵哒、妮可蹦蹦、野授仙贝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">63:00</a> 穿搭博主讨论：同质化的种草博主，难以抄作业的时尚博主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">67:00</a> 穗穗卷卷：经济缓行期的经济适用博主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4080">68:00</a> aeec：我发誓我没有恋老癖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4260">71:00</a> follow单品容易，copy穿搭博主太难</span></p><span></span><h2><span>本期制作：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>中插音乐：Jingle 贰-七濑光</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头尾曲-《Hot To Go》Chappell Roan</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播-阿南、Melody</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑-阿南</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面制作-Melody</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1136">18:56</a>使用音源来自：《恭喜发财》-圆香芹本芹（妻主），如有侵权，请联系删除</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多信息请关注「小迈一步」的同名小红书🍠以及微信公众号。</span></p>]]></description>
